  "bodyHash": "75ccf19363fae3c6",
  "content": "<h1>改進了快樂的惡魂</h1>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/improved-happy-ghast\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">➜ 此數據包的模塊版本可在這裡找到</a></p>\n<p>允許玩家創建一個<strong>不會遊蕩</strong>、<strong>更快</strong>、<strong>更小</strong>、<strong>靜音</strong>的快樂惡魂，獲得<strong>傷害提醒</strong>，甚至使用物品在生存模式中將其<strong>召喚</strong>回來。</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p>讓快樂惡魂重新變得可用，同時保持平衡且適合生存模式。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>安裝</h2>\n<p>將數據包/模塊添加到您的世界或服務器後，您應該能夠打開關於面板，該面板完全可由鼠標控制：</p>\n<pre><code>/function improved_happy_ghast:about</code></pre>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1599/564/about_panel-png.png\" alt=\"about_panel\"></p>\n<h2>使用方法</h2>\n<p>上述改進可以通過玩家在<strong>主手</strong>持有<strong>特定物品</strong>時<strong>右鍵點擊</strong>快樂惡魂來完成。作為確認，玩家將看到粒子效果並聽到微妙的聲音提示。要<strong>恢復</strong>這些更改，只需重複提到的步驟即可。</p>\n<h2>行為調整</h2>\n<p>快樂惡魂也會讓騎乘者留在水下，而不是強制其下車。</p>\n<h2>禁用遊蕩</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：毛刷</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>右鍵點擊並應用</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/170/brush-ghast-png.png\" alt=\"brush-ghast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>不再跟隨雪球且不會遊蕩</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/175/noai-png.png\" alt=\"noai\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>增加速度</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：餅乾</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>右鍵點擊並應用</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/171/cookie-ghast-png.png\" alt=\"cookie-ghast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>更快，遊戲內測量速度約為每秒10格</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/172/fast-png.png\" alt=\"fast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>減小尺寸</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：棕色蘑菇</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>右鍵點擊並應用</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/174/mushroom-ghast-png.png\" alt=\"mushroom-ghast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>與右側的正常大小相比</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/177/smol-png.png\" alt=\"smol\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>靜音</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：蜂蜜瓶</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>右鍵點擊並應用</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/169/bottle-ghast-png.png\" alt=\"bottle-ghast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>現在靜音了</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/176/silent-png.png\" alt=\"silent\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>召喚回來</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：山羊角</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>右鍵點擊並應用</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/173/horn-ghast-png.png\" alt=\"horn-ghast\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>通過綁定山羊角將其召喚到您的身邊，即使跨維度也可以</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1544/178/summon-png.png\" alt=\"summoned\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>傷害提醒</h2>\n<p><strong>物品</strong>：<em>無</em>（始終啟用）</p>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>騎乘時</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1645/733/riding-hurt-png.png\" alt=\"riding-hurt\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<blockquote>\n  <p><strong>作為已馴服的擁有者遠離時</strong></p>\n  <p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1645/734/tamed-hurt-png.png\" alt=\"tamed-hurt\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n<h2>貢獻與問題</h2>\n<p>我熱烈歡迎以下內容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>錯誤報告</li>\n<li>功能請求</li>\n<li>拉取請求</li>\n</ul>\n<p>請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/nwrenger/improved-happy-ghast/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 上提交問題或拉取請求。</p>\n<h2>許可證</h2>\n<p>本項目根據 <strong>LGPLv3 許可證</strong> 進行授權。詳情請參見 <a href=\"https://github.com/nwrenger/improved-happy-ghast/blob/main/LICENSE\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">許可證</a>。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/html",
  "type": "curseforge"
}
